# English Transfer Assistant - Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to backend/.env and fill in your values

# ============================================
# Backend Configuration
# ============================================
# See backend/.env.example for complete configuration
# Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env and customize

# Quick Start - Required Variables:
# - DATABASE_URL: PostgreSQL connection string
# - REDIS_URL: Redis connection string
# - ZHIPUAI_API_KEY: Zhipu AI API key
# - JWT_SECRET_KEY: JWT secret key

# ============================================
# Frontend Configuration
# ============================================
# Create frontend/.env.local with:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# VITE_APP_TITLE=English Transfer Assistant

# ============================================
# Getting Started
# ============================================
# 1. Copy backend environment template:
#    cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#
# 2. Edit backend/.env with your values
#
# 3. (Optional) Create frontend .env.local:
#    echo "VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000" > frontend/.env.local
#
# 4. Start services:
#    ./scripts/dev.sh
